== Notes ==

* On the "normal" [[difficulty setting]] and easier, curative spells cast on a [[player character]] are automatically maximized, or double the constant part (+1 per caster level) if already maximized.
* This spell inflicts [[positive energy damage]] on a targeted undead, unless the creature is [[PvP setting#Reactions|friendly]] to the caster.
* Contrary to the in-game description, there is no saving throw.
* Due to a .2da bug, ''ghoul touch'' is not an additional [[counterspell]] of this spell.

